    "created_at": "2020-02-25T19:35:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-02-25T19:35:18Z",
    "body": "I don't understand this proposal. Is the idea to invent some new type of `blob:` URL, the opaque `blob:` URL, which cannot be read from? Otherwise this does not seem to add anything.",
