    "updated_at": "2020-02-25T21:48:51Z",
    "body": "Thanks, that's really helpful.\r\n\r\nI'm curious about how (1) is possibly achievable. With Spectre you can read the memory of anything in your process. So solving (1) seems to require some proposal for moving canvases into a separate process, which is a pretty big ask.",
